card.statement:
Let $V$ be a irreducible, torsion free, completely pointed $U_q(\mathfrak{sl}_{n+1})$-module and $v_\lambda$ a weight vector in $V$. The action of $U_q(\mathfrak{sl}_{n+1})$ on $V$ can be extended to a $U_q(\mathfrak{gl}_{n+1})$ action such that the following relations hold:

\begin{equation*}
E_{-\varepsilon_i+\varepsilon_j}E_{\varepsilon_i-\varepsilon_j}\cdot v_\lambda=[\bar K_{i};1][\bar K_j;0]\cdot v_\lambda.
\end{equation*}
